<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Prehensile Tail</ansi> mutation

A long, dexterous tail grows from the base of your spine — quick,
sensitive, and always in motion.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Uncommon

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Steadier balance and finer control (heightened dexterity and harder
  to knock off your stride), a free grip that opens a tail equipment
  slot, and the fine control that flight demands — all without giving
  up the use of your legs

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Tail

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
